4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IZp2BbMIeGIQ7kNvwH8xtf2&_nc_oc=AdouOpmWhGEjC-tOLPOUGxV7CiXQ3zyAMa9moLeXgBf9xiM-9P1_afZ-CG2stvjjaVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJoczG6l4F2udhOWWKMejCHK8VgVV5nPMZZiMDRkdfEvg&oe=6AA54DD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kjbqlEiklssQ7kNvwFXCEkO&_nc_oc=AdqRVTfW9GX7T0rJfTCRuKDLDC2zLPBvxirTGl-xMbHFqRjSvZ_qinNMTjdRQagm3Jk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKTsAVxRHvIkh-bV3d7_JMqlwcZc9A-KcRuRMErI0ClHw&oe=6AA552B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZHS6CZ6dr54Q7kNvwGfQ6FD&_nc_oc=AdrrvTLSzZXJnpSOcBcJUhDoCEEC0P5QZRh3Pk3GrZ1SHoBE3jM2UyMMxp6a5230dfU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIYSd5mwIOe7_ItdPtC6yODNfgxvryvtwvb3dDLHKFJew&oe=6AA56055"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p